# Cloud key pools — add in Vercel dashboard (Settings → Environment Variables).
# Never commit real keys. Rotation is automatic: round-robin, 90s cooldown on limits.
# 10 Groq keys (free): console.groq.com → API Keys → Create (repeat 10x)
GROQ_KEYS=gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...,gsk_...
# 2-3 Gemini backup keys (free): aistudio.google.com → Get API key (use 2 Google accounts/projects)
GEMINI_KEYS=AI...,AI...
